      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "ক) $(a, b) = \\{x \\in R : a < x < b\\}$ কে খোলা ব্যবধি (open interval) বলে।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "(a, b) = \\{x \\in R : a < x < b\\}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 17,
      "pdfPageEnd": 17,
      "printedPageStart": 12,
      "printedPageEnd": 12,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.22-p003",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "খ) $[a, b] = \\{x \\in R : a \\leq x \\leq b\\}$ কে বদ্ধ ব্যবধি (closed interval) বলে।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "[a, b] = \\{x \\in R : a \\leq x \\leq b\\}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 17,
      "pdfPageEnd": 17,
      "printedPageStart": 12,
      "printedPageEnd": 12,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.22-p004",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "গ) $(a, b] = \\{x \\in R : a < x \\le b\\}$ এবং $[a, b) = \\{x \\in R : a \\le x < b\\}$ কে যথাক্রমে খোলা-বদ্ধ ও বদ্ধ-খোলা ব্যবধি বলে।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "(a, b] = \\{x \\in R : a < x \\le b\\}",
        "[a, b) = \\{x \\in R : a \\le x < b\\}"
      ],
